  "description": "One API over the Agora Chat SDK for Android and iOS: sign in, send and receive text messages and read the conversation list with awaitable calls and ordinary .NET events, instead of writing a per-platform adapter over Java callbacks and Objective-C completion blocks. Pulls in the platform binding that matches whichever target framework you build. Add Net.Agora.Chat.Maui in a .NET MAUI app to skip the Android Context plumbing.",
